9. DEBUG PROPS IN SEARCHBAR
================================================================================

SearchBar receives:

function SearchBar({
  searchTerm,
  onSearchChange,
  onSearch
}) {

  console.log(
    'SearchBar searchTerm:',
    searchTerm
  );

  return (

    <form onSubmit={onSearch}>

      <input
        value={searchTerm}
        onChange={onSearchChange}
      />

      <button type="submit">
        Search
      </button>

    </form>

  );

}


This helps verify that the parent is passing the correct value.


