15. CONDITIONAL LOGGING
================================================================================

Logging everything can make the console difficult to read.

Only log important conditions.


EMPTY SEARCH
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

if (!searchTerm.trim()) {

  console.warn(
    'Search term is empty'
  );

  return;

}


HTTP ERROR
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

if (!response.ok) {

  console.error(
    'API Error:',
    response.status,
    response.statusText
  );

}


NO BOOKS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

if (!data.items?.length) {

  console.warn(
    'No books found for:',
    searchTerm
  );

}


